        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1160, 9 Inch Offset Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 9\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial offset door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1160_size.gif?v=1704354720\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1160 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1156\"><b>8\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/10-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1157\"><b>10\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1158\"><b>12\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/18-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1159\"><b>18\" Offset Door Pull</b></a> and other style <a href=\"/collections/don-jo-door-pulls\"><b>Don-Jo Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 3 different materials in  6 finish choices.<br>\r\n*Solid Aluminum: Clear, Dark Bronze, or Black Anodized Aluminum <br>\r\n*Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1160 9\" Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Point: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1160.pdf?v=1704262261\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1160 Offset Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "9 Inch Offset Door Pull, Don-Jo 1160",
